-- tools/audio/sheets.json and sound_ids.json. Don't edit by hand: change
-- tools/audio/sfx.py, then run sfx.py, review.py, pack.py and upload.py.
--
-- One-shot effects share a few uploaded sheets: a sound is the region
-- start .. start + length (seconds) of its file. group is the SoundGroup
-- it plays in, volume its default volume, vary: random ±4% pitch.

